          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•pubertal delay: ⍉2ndry sex characteristics @ age when 95% of that sex & culture have started - US ~12yo ♀ · 14yo ♂"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•causes: 1° hypogonadism · 2° hypogonadism · GH deficiency · hyperprolactinemia · hypothyroidism"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•1° hypogonadism: Klinefelter (♂) · Turner (♀) - ↓testosterone or estradiol + ↑FSH & LH"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
           "indLeft": 0,
           "indRight": 0,
           "indFirst": 0,
           "spaceBefore": 0,
           "spaceAfter": 0,
           "line": null,
           "align": "left",
           "shade": null,
           "borders": null,
           "marker": null
          },
          "content": [
           {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "•2° hypogonadism: ↓hormone prod by pituitary or hypothalamus - CDGP (MC) · isolated GnRH deficiency - ↓testosterone + norm FSH & LH"
           }
          ]
         },
         {
          "type": "paragraph",
